{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00822","headline":"郊庙歌辞 周宗庙乐舞辞 章德舞 · 不详","name":"郊庙歌辞 周宗庙乐舞辞 章德舞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"清庙新，展严禋。\n恭祖德，厚人伦。\n雅乐荐，礼器陈。\n俨皇尸，列虞宾。\n神如在，声不闻。\n享必信，貌惟夤。\n想龙服，奠牺樽。\n礼既备，庆来臻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00822.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00822","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}